@using Mictlanix.BE
@using Mictlanix.BE.Model
@using Mictlanix.BE.Web.Helpers


@{
				string title = "Restauración de estado de pedido para orden de envío";

				ViewBag.Title = title;
}

<h2>@title</h2> 


<div class='clearfix'></div>
<div id='back-to-list' class='pull-left'>
</div>
<div id='confirm-button' class='pull-left'>
				@using (Html.BeginForm("RestoreDeliverableOrderStatus", "Correction"))
				{
								<input type="text" name="order_id" />
								<label for="order_id">@Resources.SalesOrderId</label>
								<button id='complete' type='submit'>@Resources.Complete</button>
				}
</div>
<div class='clearfix'></div>
<style type='text/css'>
ul.token-input-list { width: 100%; }
</style>